# Line endings (WP 0.12 in docs/phase-0-plan.md): every text file is LF in the index and in every
# checkout, Windows included, so Biome, the guards and the tests read the same bytes on the Windows CI job
# and on a lab PC as on the MacBook. Git for Windows' core.autocrlf no longer turns them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images, including the SVG art exported from Figma: never converted, never merged line by line.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.svg binary

# Fonts.
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Detection models, wasm and language data (fetched from the SHA-256 manifest, not in git).
*.task binary
*.tflite binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.wasm binary
*.traineddata binary
*.traineddata.gz binary

# Archives, installers and documents.
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
